    {
      "beat_id": "BIDEA",
      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. Claude Code is not a better model. It's the same model you talk to in the chat window, wrapped in something: a list of what it may touch, rules about touching it, and a loop that keeps asking what next. That wrapper is the harness. I'm going to switch it off, half on, and on, so you can see the model without it — and then build a tiny harness of my own around it.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 28.8,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx",
      "new_visual_element": "BrutalistHesitantWriter — the idea of the film, typed; one word reconsidered (better → different)",
