      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Five words before we start. Headless: Claude Code run from the shell with one prompt — it answers and exits. Tools list: what the model may call — read, write, run a command, use a connector. Connector, or MCP: an outside service plugged in as tools, like Google Drive. Permission mode: the rule for which tool calls need your yes. Stream json: the whole session as a log, one event per line. The receipt.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 26.4,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
