      "act": "CYCLE 1 — HARNESS ON",
      "lane": "TERMINAL",
      "narration_text": "Same model. Same sentence. Now Write is on the list. One tool call, one file, two turns. Cat it: hello. The difference between run one and run two is not intelligence. It's a list. That is what a harness is: the list of what the model can touch, the rules for touching it, and the loop that keeps asking 'what next' until it says done.",
