      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "CYCLE 1b — HALF OFF",
      "lane": "TERMINAL",
      "narration_text": "Here's the run I didn't plan. Built-in tools off — but the connectors on this Mac were still attached. So with no way to write to disk, it reached for the one write tool it had: my Google Drive. And the permission layer stopped it. Then it tried Write anyway — not enabled. Two lessons in one run. The model uses whatever tools the harness leaves on the table. And the harness has a second job: saying no.",
